- Lines: orthogonal polyline from box edge to box edge: start at (x1 + dirX * bw/2, y1) horizontal to midX, vertical to y2, horizontal to x2 - dirX*bw/2. If same row → straight horizontal line. This gives "方框平着连着方框" (boxes connected flat).
- Nodes: draw as rects (方框) with rounded corners instead of circles! The user says "方框平着连着方框" — boxes connected flat to boxes. So nodes should be boxes (rects) not circles.

